+**Evidence — same result with no RPC, plus a control that isolates the cause.**
+`test/harness/RealisticUsdt.sol` reimplements the real USDT. Constructed one way it
+returns no bools (real USDT) and `deposit` reverts; constructed the other way the
+*only* difference is that it returns bools, and the identical deposit succeeds:
+
+```
