+(The two `FeeOnTransfer` failures in that run are [A-07](#a-07).)
+
+### Fix
+
+Use `SafeERC20` for the approval as well as the transfer, and reset the allowance
+before setting it — i.e. replace line 94 with `usdt.forceApprove(address(aavePool), amount)`.
+`forceApprove` handles both the missing bool and the zero-first requirement in A-02.
+
+Better still: set the Aave allowance once, in the constructor, to `type(uint256).max`
+(via `forceApprove`), and drop the per-deposit approval entirely. Fewer moving parts
+and one less external call per deposit. Either way, `IERC20.approve` must not appear
+anywhere in a contract that touches USDT.
