+<a name="a-03"></a>
+## A-03 — Critical — Aave interest is invisible to the vault, and permanently unrecoverable.
+
+`totalAssets()` returns `totalAssetsStored`, a number that only ever moves when
+`deposit()` or `withdraw()` writes to it. Nothing in the contract ever reads the
+vault's aUSDT balance. In fact the `aUsdt` immutable is written in the constructor
+and then never referenced again:
+
+```
+$ grep -n "aUsdt" src/UsdtYieldVault.sol
+41:    IERC20 public immutable aUsdt;
+68:    /// @param _aUsdt The Aave aUSDT receipt token.
+72:    constructor(address _usdt, address _aUsdt, address _aavePool, uint256 _depositFeeBps, address initialOwner)
+76:        aUsdt = IERC20(_aUsdt);
+```
+
+Two consequences, both bad:
+
+1. **Depositors receive no yield at all.** Share price is `totalAssetsStored / totalShares`;
+   Aave interest moves neither term. This is a yield vault that pays 0%.
+2. **The yield is not merely unpaid, it is unreachable.** It accumulates as aUSDT owned
+   by the vault, and there is no sweep, no rescue, no owner withdrawal, and no share
+   that can claim it. Once the last shareholder exits, it is locked at that address forever.
+
+**Evidence — against the real Aave V3 pool at `0x87870Bca…`, on a mainnet fork.**
+Because A-01 makes `deposit()` impossible on mainnet, the test builds the post-deposit
+state directly: it supplies 1,000,000 USDT into the *real* pool on behalf of the vault
+(permissionless) and writes the share bookkeeping a working `deposit()` would have
+written. Everything after that is the unmodified contract against real Aave.
+
+```
+$ forge test --match-path test/fork/A03_YieldStrandedFork.t.sol -vv
+Ran 2 tests for test/fork/A03_YieldStrandedFork.t.sol:A03_YieldStrandedFork
+[FAIL: depositor's claim should track the vault's real Aave position: 1000000000000 < 1030547859922] test_AaveInterestIsInvisibleToTheVault() (gas: 67034)
+Logs:
+  aUSDT balance   t0 : 999999999999
+  aUSDT balance   t1 : 1030547859922
+  interest earned    : 30547859923
+  totalAssets()   t1 : 1000000000000
+  sharePrice()    t0 : 1000000
+  sharePrice()    t1 : 1000000
+  alice underlying t1: 1000000000000
+
+[FAIL: vault should hold nothing once all shares are burned: 33547859922 != 0] test_YieldIsUnreachableAfterEveryoneExits() (gas: 220446)
+Logs:
+  aUSDT before exit : 1030547859922
+  alice received    : 997000000000
+  shares outstanding: 0
+  totalAssets()     : 0
+  aUSDT STRANDED    : 33547859922
+
+Suite result: FAILED. 0 passed; 2 failed; 0 skipped; finished in 404.43ms (596.88µs CPU time)
+
+Ran 1 test suite in 405.29ms (404.43ms CPU time): 0 tests passed, 2 failed, 0 skipped (2 total tests)
+
+Failing tests:
+Encountered 2 failing tests in test/fork/A03_YieldStrandedFork.t.sol:A03_YieldStrandedFork
+[FAIL: depositor's claim should track the vault's real Aave position: 1000000000000 < 1030547859922] test_AaveInterestIsInvisibleToTheVault() (gas: 67034)
+[FAIL: vault should hold nothing once all shares are burned: 33547859922 != 0] test_YieldIsUnreachableAfterEveryoneExits() (gas: 220446)
+
