+  it from the accounting. Reduce `totalAssetsStored` by `netAssets`, not `grossAssets`,
+  so the fee stays inside the pot and lifts the share price. This becomes moot if you
+  adopt the A-03 fix, since a balance-derived `totalAssets()` picks it up automatically.
+- **If it should go to the treasury:** send it somewhere — withdraw the gross from Aave
+  and transfer the fee to a `feeRecipient`.
+
+Either way, `WITHDRAW_FEE_BPS` is a `constant` — it cannot be turned off after deploy.
+Consider making it settable behind the same bound and timelock as A-05.
